  Assets:A  1,234,567.89 EUR
  Assets:B  -1,234,567.89 EUR
2026-01-04 * "a plus sign"
  Assets:A  +5 EUR
  Assets:B  -5 EUR
2026-01-05 * "a trailing dot"
  Assets:A  5. EUR
  Assets:B  -5 EUR
2026-01-06 * "very small and exact"
  Assets:A  0.000000000000001 EUR
  Assets:B  -0.000000000000001 EUR
2026-01-07 * "negative zero"
  Assets:A  -0.00 EUR
  Assets:B  0 EUR
